WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:05.960
Woman: They all say the same thing, I'll believe it when I see it

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.820
But that's backwards

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:14.180
Belief comes first. Only then can you see it.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.320
I'm asking you to use your imagination

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:27.460
We've got one shot at this and I need the best team

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.920
My focus right now is my daughter

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:35.579
Tell me and say no I'm gonna say no

00:00:37.789 --> 00:00:39.702
Man: What we do is dangerous

00:00:39.702 --> 00:00:42.423
Woman: I'm willing to take that risk

00:00:42.423 --> 00:00:43.720
Man: I don't know if I am

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.940
How does that make you feel, putting your lives at that much risk?

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.020
What about your family?

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:52.760
All our families know what we signed up for

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.440
You ever think about mom?

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:57.120
You can't let her bring us down, too

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:00.580
Denise, open the door baby

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.200
Did we make a mistake?

00:01:02.204 --> 00:01:05.620
We got four people whose lives depend on my judgment

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.660
I can't have you doubting me

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:08.680
Computer: Limit exceeded

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:11.600
You could be the person that discovers life on Mars

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.800
I need you here

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.320
and I don't want you to go

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:19.340
I'll never have the opportunity to do work this important

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:23.380
Woman: Imagine the responsibility the astronaut shoulder

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:26.820
The personal sacrifices that they've endured

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:28.960
Man: I need people who are going to do the hard thing

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:33.020
Woman: And then they strap themselves to a rocket and they risk their lives

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:34.000
Screaming: Mom!

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.300
Enough already!

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:37.720
Woman: That's five people

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:44.940
Fulfilling the destiny of 8 billion

